  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building Support to NGO:s in Turkey</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kapacitetst&#xf6;d till turkiska NGOs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A number of Turkish NGOs are offered capacity building support        through a consultant team contracted by Sida. The capacity building   is design to suit the needs of each organisation but are in general   terms focused on RBM and organisational sustainability.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett antal turkiska frivilligorganisationer erbjuds kapacitetsst&#xf6;d     genom ett konsultteam som har kontrakterats av Sida. Kapacitetst&#xf6;det  &#xe4;r utvecklat f&#xf6;r att passa varje organisations behov men &#xe4;r generellt sett fokuserade p&#xe5; RBM och organisatorisk h&#xe5;llbarhet.</narrative>
  </description>
